Package: SGCB
Type: Package
Title: Generalized-Gamma Differential Expression for Bulk RNA-seq
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Developer", "Name", , "dev@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Differential analysis for two-group bulk RNA-seq based on
    Generalized Gamma (GG) modeling and information-geometric natural-gradient
    estimation. The pipeline uses TMM preprocessing, limma-style fitFDist
    variance shrinkage, moderated-t testing for primary DE, and additional
    diagnostic channels for GG mean, manifold distance, differential
    variability (DV), and differential shape (DG). It reports DD via Cauchy
    combination of DV and DG-gamma, SGCB_Score via Cauchy combination of DE and
    DD, and optional calibrated bootstrap uncertainty columns.
